x"><h2 class="Rm7uEec qcm1mUj I2jq234 PwaZ22p Qgmlf-n" style="--alignment:start;--font-size:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*24);--line-height:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*32);--font-variation:&quot;opsz&quot; 100;--font-size-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*32);--line-height-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*42);--font-variation-medium-up:&quot;opsz&quot; 100">Canva Verified Experts</h2><div class="_6LuO_x2 qcm1mUj I2jq234 XhK5Vs8 s7iDOpk" style="--alignment:start;--font-size:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*16);--line-height:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*26);--font-variation:unset;--font-size-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*16);--line-height-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*26);--font-variation-medium-up:unset"><span class="jv_R6g" style="--NZu1Zw:8px"><p style="padding:0;margin:0"><span>Canva Verified Experts are recognized leaders with deep expertise in Canva. They are passionate educators and professionals who help others unlock the full potential of Canva through high-quality training and practical guidance. Members receive early access to select features and exclusive program opportunities.</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0"><span>Check out our current </span><a class="Ej7lEg WkdUeQ _3bC2IQ" href="https://www.canva.com/community/canva-verified-experts/" draggable="false" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canva Verified Experts<span id="_R_1pdkipt6_" class="V5YmAg">⁠<span class="_pFsfA">(opens in a new tab or window)</span></span></a><span>.</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0"><span style="font-weight:600">How do I become a Canva Verified Expert?</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0"><span>Currently, this program is by invite only.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="A7kraOt _zF40u8 CPBr2iX Y1TxiMR"><div class="_4-gPR6y"><div class="SwlpcA" style="--lIX0Wg:32px;--Bgy4yg:24px;--CcBh2g:2;--S8wiIA:1;--QrbJUA:center"><div class="npfyfJH WFX_GpW _8Ocs1c6"><div class="KP5ekAg" style="border-ra