<source srcSet="https://content-management-files.canva.com/b2528406-f54f-4496-9bb5-5cb5b8f1da7a/CopyofQuickpagesContentFeatureImagetemplate1.png?resize-width=600" media="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 599px) and (max-resolution: 1dppx)"/><source srcSet="https://content-management-files.canva.com/b2528406-f54f-4496-9bb5-5cb5b8f1da7a/CopyofQuickpagesContentFeatureImagetemplate1.png?resize-width=1200" media="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 599px) and (min-resolution: 1.001dppx)"/><div style="height:100%;width:100%;position:absolute;top:0"><div class="IwXXkw _qImYg JbJFjg _CObZw"></div></div><img src="https://content-management-files.canva.com/b2528406-f54f-4496-9bb5-5cb5b8f1da7a/CopyofQuickpagesContentFeatureImagetemplate1.png" alt="" width="900" loading="lazy" class="wfteUP8 _9N8KNO4" style="object-fit:cover;object-position:center center"/></picture></div></div><div class="QFWNFSe WFX_GpW pUgqvUx"><div class="pgwnrjs" style="--alignment:0"><div class="jv_R6g" style="--NZu1Zw:16px"><h2 class="Rm7uEec qcm1mUj I2jq234 PwaZ22p Qgmlf-n" style="--alignment:start;--font-size:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*24);--line-height:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*32);--font-variation:&quot;opsz&quot; 100;--font-size-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*32);--line-height-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*42);--font-variation-medium-up:&quot;opsz&quot; 100">Canva Design Community</h2><div class="_6LuO_x2 qcm1mUj I2jq234 XhK5Vs8 s7iDOpk" style="--alignment:start;--font-size:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*16);--line-height:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*26);--font-variation:unset;--font-size-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*16);--line-height-medium-up:calc(var(----lgQg, .1rem)*8/8*26);--font-variation-medium-up:unset"><span class="jv_R6g" style="--NZu1Zw:8px"><p style="padding:0;margin:0"><span>Established in 2016, the Canva Design Community is the go-to space and community for all Canva users to discuss everything Canva, or anything design-related on Facebook. The group is driven by people sharing their designs in order to inspire others and also to receive feedback. Members can also learn new tips and tricks with our tutorials, as well as what&#x27;s new in Canva.</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0"><span style="font-weight:600">How do I join the Design Community?</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0"><span>The Design Community is open to all! Just agree to our rules and request access to our Facebook group.</span><br/></p></span></div></div><span class="_8aVEnQ" style="--FnDW1g:24px" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="Glaia0B" style="--alignment:start;--direction:column;--direction-small-up:row"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/220885194946296" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="_5KtATA Xj0kcw LQzFZw VgvqkQ _8ERLTg Z3nT2A LQzFZw VgvqkQ _4_iekA j34Zww aqbYPg _3FvZZg"><span class="khPe7Q">Join Design Community</span><span id="_R_1bkupt6_"><span class="_pFsfA">(opens in a new tab or window)</span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="A7kraOt _zF40u8 CPBr2iX Y1TxiMR"><div class="_4-gPR6y"><div class="SwlpcA" style="--lIX0Wg:32px;--Bgy4yg:24px;--CcBh2g:2;--S8wiIA:1;--QrbJUA:center"><div class="npfyfJH kXFBzxL _8Ocs1c6"><div class="KP5ekAg" style="border-radius:16px"><picture class="m-HO09n"><source srcSet="https://content-management-files.canva.com/a2ae0d3e-9842-4edd-8ee3-9a9819f83f8a/6.teachers.png?resize-format=avif&amp;resize-width=900" type="image/avif" media="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-resolution: 1dppx)"/><source srcSet="https://content-management-files.canva.com/a2ae0d3e-9842-4edd-8ee3-9a9819f83f8a/6.teachers.png?resize-format=avif&amp;resize-width=1800" type="image/avif" media="(min-width: 1200px) and (min-resolution: 1.001dppx)"/><source srcSet="https://content-management-files.canva.com/a2ae0d3e-9842-4edd-8ee3-9a9819f83f8a/6.teachers.png?resize-format=avif&amp;resize-width=600" type="image/avif" media="(min-width: 900px) and (max-width: 1199px) and (max-resolution: 1dppx)"/><s